{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #27213e; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#f4cd62 0,#f4cd62 8px,#27213e 8px,#27213e 16px); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 8px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f3edff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 12px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #f3edff; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 16px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #3d315a; border: 3px solid #f4cd62; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 22px 16px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e按下存档键，进入复古深紫像素世界——硬朗折角与高对比游戏色带让文章瞬间好玩起来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px solid #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e用街机存档点记录高光时刻\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e深紫主机背景配荧光青紫点缀，在严肃商务与温柔文艺之间劈出一条极具个性的潮流风格。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px dashed #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e人生没有标准攻略，但每一次认真记录都是珍贵的存档点。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/tech-console.jpg\" alt=\"暗调发光极简科技桌面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px solid #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e复古像素风的玩法场景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e独立游戏测评、复古数码与极客玩具\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e创意策划、活动预告与年轻社群推送\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e深紫亮色高反差，缩略图一眼吸睛\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c9b9eb; color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003eSAVE COMPLETE —— 准备好进入下一关了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
